      "writtenOn": "2024-05-16T18:50:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like we could just remove the whole `#if defined(SK_PDF_USE_HARFBUZZ_SUBSET)` bit from `SkPDFSubsetFont.cpp` and let that roll out and then just go and remove the `SK_PDF_USE_HARFBUZZ_SUBSET` defines at leisure. It used to make a bit of sense to also allow a no-subsetter option back when we also had a choice of subsetters, but we only support the HarfBuzz one here at the moment and the reality is that using PDF without the subsetter is a bit crazy.",
      "parentUuid": "34981a0e_156e55ca",
